sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Web Client
    participant API as FastAPI Gateway
    participant Sup as LangGraph Supervisor
    participant Agent as Specialized Agent
    participant MCP as MCP Gateway
    participant Ext as External Service (Gmail/Cal)
    participant DB as Postgres + pgvector

    User->>API: POST /api/v1/agent/stream {message, conversationId}
    API->>Sup: Initialize Graph Run & Retrieve Context
    Sup->>DB: Query Relevant Memories (pgvector cosine similarity)
    DB-->>Sup: Return Top-K Semantic Memories & User Preferences
    API-->>User: SSE Event: step:start (Understanding request & memory retrieval)

    Sup->>Agent: Delegate Subtask (e.g., CommsAgent: Search Emails)
    API-->>User: SSE Event: step:start (Gmail Search)
    Agent->>MCP: Call mcp-gmail.search_threads(query="tax docs")
    MCP->>Ext: Gmail API Request
    Ext-->>MCP: Thread list & summaries
    MCP-->>Agent: Structured Tool Output
    API-->>User: SSE Event: step:complete (Gmail Search finished)

    Agent-->>Sup: Return Formatted Email Context
    Sup->>Sup: Synthesize Plan (Draft Reply)

    alt Action Requires Human Approval (e.g., Send Email)
        Sup->>API: Trigger Approval Required State
        API-->>User: SSE Event: approval:required {requestId, diff, recipient, body}
        Note over User,API: Execution Pauses in Redis Checkpoint
        User->>API: POST /api/v1/approvals/{id}/decision {decision: "approve"}
        API->>Sup: Resume Graph with Approval Grant
    end

    Sup->>Agent: Execute Final Tool (Send Email)
    Agent->>MCP: Call mcp-gmail.send_message(...)
    MCP->>Ext: Transmit Email
    Ext-->>MCP: Success Confirmation

    Sup->>DB: Record Episodic Run & Distill New Learned Facts
    Sup->>API: Complete Execution
    API-->>User: SSE Event: run:complete {summary, metrics}
